url: "https://vthielens.github.io/pfd-studio/"
abstract: >-
  PFD Studio is a free, offline, browser-based editor for process flow
  diagrams. It ships the complete ISO 10628-2:2012 graphical symbol library
  (295 symbols in 29 groups, with English, French and Dutch names), lets
  users add connection ports to any symbol and draws lines that stay
  attached to the ports when equipment is moved. Drawings export to SVG,
  PNG, PDF and an equipment list for spreadsheets.
